subsided by 2018; residual insecurity is armed banditry, urban delinquency and occasional unrest or police abuses. Peri-urban villages (Katabaie, Lukole, Diku, Mushiya) fall under PNC posts and customary chiefs. Live web research was unavailable in this run (search budget exhausted), so the assessment relies on background knowledge and the default-state-presence rule, with limited confidence."}}